      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `normalize_expense.py` that normalizes extracted expense fields into a standard JSON schema using an external provider, I need to select a concrete external provider. For this task, I will use the Amazon Comprehend service, which is a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. This service can help in normalizing text data. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Comprehend client to identify the provider in the code. </thinking>\n",
